<div class="card">
  <h1>Dummy Phoenix app</h1>
  <p>
    Host wiring for Lens: <code>config :phoenix_lens, repo: Dummy.Repo</code>
    and <code>lens "/lens"</code>
    in the router. Seeded user <code>alice@example.com</code>
    must never appear in Lens outputs.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a class="btn" href="/lens">Open Lens</a>
  </p>
